        <mxCell id="legend_mvvm" value="&lt;b&gt;FLUTTER CLIENT (MVVM):&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;- View (LoginPage) = UI Widget&#xa;- ViewModel (AuthViewModel) = State + Logic&#xa;- Model/Service (AuthService) = API call&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;NESTJS BACKEND (MVC):&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;- Controller (AuthController) = Route + Validasi DTO&#xa;- Service (AuthService) = Business Logic&#xa;- Model = Supabase Auth (external)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Times New Roman;size=15;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
